{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model with multiprofile data and avgpool aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5907 (F1: 0.5727). The result suggests RNA-only multiprofile data may contribute less than multimodal configurations, but the exact role of multiprofile data versus aggregation remains uncertain due to lack of direct comparison to singleprofile or no-aggregation variants. The lower accuracy compared to multimodal setups indicates potential value in multimodal integration, though other factors like fusion or image data could also influence performance."
}

